        "bullets": [
          "Each position means records applied within the named history. The reference is this session\u2019s minimum read token, not an elected leader or a derived quorum.",
          "The ruler compares only matching sequence identities. Gaps are record counts; reported milliseconds are separate observations, never estimated from those gaps.",
          "Per-replica observation labels can differ. The panel preserves offline and unknown states instead of silently treating a matching position as healthy."
